---
title: MF-03 · CV Sourcing delivery and Client decision
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor HR as Internal HR
  participant API as SourcingDelivery endpoints
  participant H as Sourcing handlers
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant W as SourcingAutoAcceptWorker
  HR->>API: Deliver shortlisted CVs
  API->>H: DeliverSourcingCvs
  alt target reached
  API-->>HR: 409 SOURCING_TARGET_REACHED
  else within target
  H->>DB: SourcingDelivery DELIVERED, ReviewDueAt
  H->>CL: Notify: CVs to review
  end
  CL->>API: Accept / Reject (reason)
  H->>DB: ACCEPTED (commission per CV) or REJECTED
  W->>DB: After review period: DELIVERED → AUTO_ACCEPTED
  HR->>API: Replace rejected CV with a backup
  H->>DB: Old REPLACED, new DELIVERED
